  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“不可思议之国的你”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞分头行动的阳介和直斗\n　也已经回来了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}欢迎回来！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 06 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你、你好！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}那个，\n是玲和善……对吧。\n啊，应该叫玲学姐、善学长……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}那个……多大？\n几……年级的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 0B 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……几……年级的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}啊？我吗？\n……１年级。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}……１年级！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}１年级？\n什么嘛，同岁啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}……你们为什么会在里面？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}我觉得必须离开这里。\n所以在寻找能出去的地方。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}出去？\n要出去就走校门啊。\n你该不会……是路痴吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}没有出口。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……哈？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}没有，出口。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}果然啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}哎，哎，什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}校门是有，可就是出不去。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}巽同学平时用的那条小路，\n甚至根本不存在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}等等，你怎么知道\n围栏上的洞！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}而且，我今天早上还走过呢！\n不可能没有吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}就是没有。\n……我们出不去了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:21:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}还有，那座时钟塔……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}时钟塔……雪子说的\n七大不可思议里的那个！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_070.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}亲眼看看比较快……\n请跟我来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
